  vendorName: Mender Jace
  offerText: Sell me your bulky water purification filters. I need the raw charcoal
    for my forge. I will pay a heavy purse, but your drinking water will taste of
    rust and grit.
  acceptResultText: Jace hauls the filters away. Your room is spacious and your wallet
    is thick, but drinking the foul, gritty tap water makes you sick to your stomach.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to poison yourself for money. You enjoy a glass of
    clean, pure water in your cramped room.
